            620.0,
            50.0,
            340.0,
            260.0
          ],
          "text": "GENERATION\n\n  1 sources\n\nWAVESHAPING\n\n  2 overdrive~ pong~\n  3 signal maths\n  4 lookup~\n  5 degrade~ downsamp~\n  6 package waveshapers\n\nREFERENCE\n\n  7 overlaps & sources",
