                    [
                      "_text",
                      "Neither object has a single attribute. Every control on this page is an inlet.<br>## Overlaps<br>\u2014<br>{b}object|what it is instead<br>`sah~`|the primitive underneath sample-rate reduction: hold a value until a trigger says otherwise<br>`trunc~` on tab 3|the bit-depth half on its own at one bit<br>`round~ @nearest`|quantise amplitude to any step rather than only a power of two<br>\u2014<br><br>## Packages<br>\u2014<br>{b}package|what it adds<br>**ableton-dsp** *ships inside Max*|`abl.device.redux~` is the full version: `@rate` in Hz \u00b7 `@bitdepth` 1 to 16 \u00b7 `@jitter` \u00b7 a `@prefilter` and a `@post_filter` that decide how much aliasing survives \u00b7 `@shape` morphs the quantiser between linear and A-law<br>**Upshot**|`upshot_bitcrusher` \u2014 a simpler wrapper around the same idea<br>**ears**|no offline equivalent. These two are realtime only.<br>\u2014"
                    ],
                    [
                      "_wrap",
                      1
                    ]
                  ]
                }
