           \"fontname\": \"Monaco\",\n              \"border\": 0,\n              \"textcolor\": [\n                0.68,\n                0.7,\n                0.74,\n                1.0\n              ],\n              \"filename\": \"butter_comment.js\",\n              \"fontsize\": 10.0\n            },\n            \"inlets\": 1,\n            \"outlets\": 2,\n            \"outlettype\": [\n              \"\",\n              \"\"\n            ],\n            \"box_extras\": {\n              \"embedstate\": [\n                [\n                  \"bgcolor\",\n                  0,\n                  0,\n                  0,\n                  0\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubble\",\n                  0\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubble_bgcolor\",\n                  1,\n                  1,\n                  1,\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubble_outlinecolor\",\n                  0,\n                  0,\n                  0,\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubblepoint\",\n                  0.5\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubbleside\",\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubbletextmargin\",\n                  0\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"bubbleusescolors\",\n                  0\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"underline\",\n                  0\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_autoheight\",\n                  0\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_bullet\",\n                  \"\\u2022\"\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_codebg\",\n                  0.0,\n                  0.0,\n                  0.0,\n                  0.18\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_headingscale\",\n                  0.75\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_hyperlinkcolor\",\n                  0.2,\n                  0.45,\n                  0.95,\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_indent\",\n                  14\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_linespacing\",\n                  1.2\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_linkunderline\",\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_markdown\",\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_monofont\",\n                  \"\"\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_padding\",\n                  8\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_paraspacing\",\n                  0.5\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_pointsize\",\n                  12,\n                  10\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_sendto\",\n                  \"\"\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_tablecolor\",\n                  0.45,\n                  0.46,\n                  0.5,\n                  0.7\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_tablefill\",\n                  1\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_tablepad\",\n                  4\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_tablewrap\",\n                  0.3\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_text\",\n                  \"# Waveform generation<br>Every generator on tab 1 is in this list.<br>\\u2014<br>{b}job|objects<br>sine / wavetable|`cycle~` `wave~` `2d.wave~` `triangle~` `trapezoid~` `table~` `mc.cycle~` `mc.wave~` \\u00b7 `sinx~` `cos~` `cosx~` make a sine from a signal but have no frequency of their own<br>ramp / phase|`phasor~` `rate~` `plugphasor~` `kink~` `twist~` `phasewrap~` `phaseshift~` `mc.phasor~`<br>antialiased|`saw~` `tri~` `rect~` \\u00b7 and `mc.saw~` `mc.tri~` `mc.rect~`<br>impulses|`train~` `click~` `what~`<br>noise|`noise~` `pink~` `rand~` `mc.noise~ @chans n`<br>banks / additive|`ioscbank~` `oscbank~` \\u2014 the same bank without the glide<br>buffers|`buffer~` `peek~` `poke~` `record~` `waveform~` `index~` `play~` `groove~`<br>envelopes|`line~` `curve~` `adsr~` `shape~` `ramp~` `updown~` `twist~` \\u2014 a neighbouring family<br>\\u2014<br><br># Waveshaping<br>\\u2014<br>{b}job|objects<br>fold / wrap / clip|`pong~` on tab 2 does all three \\u00b7 `clip~` is its clip mode alone plus a Zero mode \\u00b7 `phasewrap~` is the wrap mode fixed at +pi and -pi \\u00b7 `deltaclip~` limits slope not level<br>saturate|`overdrive~` on tab 2 \\u00b7 `tanh~` and the rest of tab 3 \\u00b7 `round~` quantises instead<br>signal maths|`tanh~` `sinh~` `cosh~` `atanh~` `asinh~` `acosh~` \\u00b7 `sinx~` `cosx~` `tanx~` `cos~` `asin~` `acos~` `atan~` \\u00b7 `abs~` `sqrt~` `trunc~` `delta~` on tab 3 \\u00b7 `pow~` `log~` `atan2~` `minimum~` `maximum~` `scale~` `rampsmooth~` `slide~` `avg~` `sah~` \\u00b7 `zerox~` `change~` `edge~` `thresh~` report rather than shape<br>transfer table|`lookup~` on tab 4 \\u00b7 `table~` \\u00b7 `peek~` writes the curve \\u00b7 `buffer~` `fill` and `apply`<br>phase distortion|`kink~` `twist~` and `cycle~`'s phase inlet \\u2014 all on tab 1 \\u00b7 `phaseshift~`<br>lo-fi|`degrade~` `downsamp~` on tab 5 \\u00b7 `sah~` `trunc~`<br>\\u2014<br><br># Packages<br>\\u2014<br>{b}package|objects<br>**ableton-dsp** *ships inside Max*|generation: `abl.dsp.meldosc~` and most of its engines alone \\u2014 `basicshapes~` `bitgrunge~` `bubble~` `chip~` `crackle~` `dualbasicshapes~` `extratone~` `filterednoise~` `fmbass~` `foldfm~` `harmonicfm~` `noiseloop~` `noisyshapes~` `rain~` `shepard~` `simplefm~` `squarefifth~` `squaresync~` `subosc~` `swarm~` `tarp~` `velvetnoise~` `ramp~` `euclid~` `pulsate~` `stereolfo~` `modulator~` \\u00b7 shaping: `abl.dsp.waveshaper~` `abl.dsp.expshaper~` `abl.dsp.saturator~` `abl.dsp.overdrive~` `abl.dsp.distortion~` `abl.dsp.fuzz~` `abl.dsp.filther~` `abl.device.redux~` `abl.device.roar~` `abl.device.drumbuss~`<br>**BEAP** *ships inside Max*|`bp.Oscillator` `bp.Wavetable` `bp.FM` `bp.Macro Oscillator` `bp.Quad Harmonic` `bp.Mono Risset Oscillator` `bp.Cloud` `bp.Granular` `bp.Karplus` `bp.Cell` `bp.Noise` `bp.GaussianNoise` and the whole LFO folder \\u00b7 `bp.Waveshaper` `bp.Wavefolder` `bp.Folder` `bp.Table` \\u00b7 Paste From > BEAP<br>**CNMAT Externals**|`sinusoids~` `harmonics~` `oscillators~`<br>**Data Knot**|`dk.mangrove~` `dk.justfriends~` `dk.fourses~` `dk.rungler~` `dk.quantussy~` `dk.avdog~`<br>**TS.Modular**|`ts.sine` `ts.rect` `ts.triangle` `ts.complexOsc` `ts.tanhOsc` `ts.sai` `ts.morphi` `ts.aKastle` \\u00b7 `ts.waveshaper` `ts.wavefolder` `ts.saturation` `ts.overdrive`<br>**PeRColate**|`terrain~` \\u00b7 `gen9` `gen10` `gen7` `gen5` `gen20` `gen24` `gen25` \\u00b7 `gen17` for a Chebyshev table \\u00b7 `flip~` superseded by `pong~` \\u00b7 `weave~` \\u00b7 `dcblock~`<br>**s2n**|`sn.drive~` `mc.sn.drive~` `mcs.sn.drive~`<br>**dada**|`dada.terrain~` `dada.peanos~` `dada.music~`<br>**ACToolkit**|`jeynoise~` `flipflop~`<br>**Sadam Library**|`sadam.standardMap~`<br>**Panning Tools**|`noiseband~` `noisebandstereo~` `polysimpleFM~`<br>**abclib**|`abc.generator~` `abc.mc.multinoise~` `abc.soundcoat~` `abc.env.noise~`<br>**MC Movement Studies**|`db.mc.fmwavetable~` `db.wavetable2polybuffer`<br>**Upshot**|`upshot_noisegenerator` `upshot_alpha` `upshot_polysynth` \\u00b7 `upshot_distortion` `upshot_waveshapedistortion` `upshot_bitcrusher`<br>**ABL Effect Modules**|`Abl.Waveshaper~` `Abl.Saturator~` `Abl.Redux~` `Abl.Distortion~` `Abl.Overdrive~` `Abl.Fuzz~` `Abl.Filther~` \\u2014 panelled modules that carry MC stereo cords<br>**ears** *offline*|`ears.clip~` `ears.overdrive~`<br>**PnP.Maxtools**|`pnp.distort~`<br>**modulo**|`mo.fm~`<br>**RNBO Synth Building Blocks**|`sbb.osc.wavetable` \\u2014 inside RNBO patches only<br>\\u2014<br><br>Already in this repo: `patches/shootouts/distortion-shootout.maxpat` auditions eighteen distortion and lo-fi units side by side. `distortion-modules-shootout.maxpat` does the same for BEAP and .amxd devices.\"\n                ],\n                [\n                  \"_wrap\",\n                  1\n                ]\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"connections\": [],\n        \"patcher_extras\": {\n          \"showontab\": 1\n        }\n      },\n      \"box_extras\": {\n        \"comment\": \"no inlets or outlets \\u2014 this subpatcher is a tab of the window; it reaches the master output through s~ REF_L / s~ REF_R\",\n        \"saved_object_attributes\": {\n          \"description\": \"\",\n          \"digest\": \"\",\n          \"globalpatchername\": \"\",\n          \"tags\": \"\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"connections\": [\n    [\n      \"r_l\",\n      0,\n      \"gain\",\n      0\n    ],\n    [\n      \"r_r\",\n      0,\n      \"gain\",\n      1\n    ],\n    [\n      \"gain\",\n      0,\n      \"dac\",\n      0\n    ],\n    [\n      \"gain\",\n      1,\n      \"dac\",\n      1\n    ],\n    [\n      \"r_l\",\n      0,\n      \"master_scope\",\n      0\n    ]\n  ],\n  \"patcher_extras\": {\n    \"showontab\": 1,\n    \"showrootpatcherontab\": 1\n  }\n}\n--- END SPEC ---",
          "fontsize": 9.0,
          "hidden": 1
        }
      }
